を擬似的に実施し、長時間労働医師への効果的な面接指導の方法を学ぶロールプレイ研修です。\n\nぜひご参加ください！\n\n■オンライン開催／参加費無料\n■お申し込み\nhttps://t.co/S0Ed5fD2ZN https://t.co/CX2P5oqA4A","id_str":"2105130908940681274","is_quote_status":false,"lang":"ja","possibly_sensitive":false,"possibly_sensitive_editable":true,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":3,"retweeted":false,"user_id_str":"180585090"},"rest_id":"2105130908940681274","source":"<a href=\"https://social.userlocal.jp/\" rel=\"nofollow\">Userlocal SocialInsight</a>","unmention_data":{},"views":{"count":"9426","state":"EnabledWithCount"}}}}},"entryId":"tweet-2105130908940681274","sortIndex":"2105186896480042984"},{"content":{"__typename":"TimelineTimelineItem","clientEventInfo":{"component":"suggest_organic_list_tweet","details":{"timelinesDetails":{"injectionType":"OrganicListTweet"}},"element":"tweet"},"entryType":"TimelineTimelineItem","itemContent":{"__typename":"TimelineTweet","itemType":"TimelineTweet","tweetDisplayType":"Tweet","tweet_results":{"result":{"__typename":"Tweet","card":{"legacy":{"binding_values":[{"key":"photo_image_full_size_large","value":{"image_value":{"height":419,"url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/card_img/2105115805163859968/9fvVFuSP?format=jpg&name=800x419","width":800},"type":"IMAGE"}},{"key":"app_star_rating","value":{"string_value":"4.74372","type":"STRING"}},{"key":"thumbnail_image","value":{"image_value":{"height":147,"url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/card_img/2105115805163859968/9fvVFuSP?format=jpg&name=280x150","width":280},"type":"IMAGE"}},{"key":"description","value":{"string_value":"財務省主税局です。 以前6月に、「2026年の税制改正で何が変わる？」をテーマに、今年の税制改正のポイントをご紹介しました。 税制改正では、税負担の見直しや新たな制度の創設など、さまざまな変更が行われます。 しかし、その内容を理解するためには、まず「税」そのものについて知ることがとても重要です。 皆さんは、「税」にはそもそもどのような意義や役割があるのかご存じでしょうか。 私たちは日々、さま...","type":"STRING"}},{"key":"domain","value":{"string_value":"mof-gov.note.jp","type":"STRING"}},{"key":"app_is_free","value":{"string_value":"true","type":"STRING"}},{"key":"thumbnail_image_large","value":{"image_value":{"height":314,"url":"https://