災に対する国際緊急援助活動の終結を命じました。今般の活動では、陸自CH-47輸送ヘリ3機により消火活動を実施しました。\n \n今般の活動に対し、インドネシア政府から高い評価と感謝の意が表明されるなど、インドネシアとの防衛協力の深化に寄与しました。防衛省・自衛隊は、今後とも、国際社会の一員として、人道的観点から必要な支援に積極的に取り組んでまいります。\nhttps://t.co/z7HS3WejM8"}}},"quoted_status_result":{"result":{"__typename":"Tweet","core":{"user_results":{"result":{"__typename":"User","action_counts":{"favorites_count":127},"affiliates_highlighted_label":{},"avatar":{"image_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1182494221720145920/1f6PGrY1_normal.jpg"},"banner":{"image_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/268732024/1693473523"},"core":{"created_at":"Sat Mar 19 10:39:03 +0000 2011","name":"防衛省・自衛隊","screen_name":"ModJapan_jp"},"dm_permissions":{"can_dm":false},"follow_request_sent":false,"has_graduated_access":true,"id":"VXNlcjoyNjg3MzIwMjQ=","is_blue_verified":true,"location":{"location":"東京都新宿区市谷本村町5-1"},"media_permissions":{"can_media_tag":true},"notifications_settings":{"notifications_enabled":false},"parody_commentary_fan_label":"None","pinned_items":{},"possibly_sensitive":false,"privacy":{"protected":false},"profile_bio":{"description":"#防衛省・自衛隊 の公式アカウントです。防衛省の政策や各種活動などの最新情報を発信します。英語による発信▸ @ModJapan_en 災害派遣等の発信▸ @ModJapan_saigai 【Facebook】https://t.co/MhbTYVAO9J 【Instagram】 https://t.co/xfOJ2bbbiJ","entities":{"description":{"urls":[{"display_url":"facebook.com/mod.japn","expanded_url":"http://facebook.com/mod.japn","indices":[104,127],"url":"https://t.co/MhbTYVAO9J"},{"display_url":"Instagram.com/modjapan","expanded_url":"http://Instagram.com/modjapan","indices":[140,163],"url":"https://t.co/xfOJ2bbbiJ"}]},"url":{"urls":[{"display_url":"mod.go.jp","expanded_url":"https://www.mod.go.jp/","indices":[0,23],"url":"https://t.co/2xSIikAYYe"}]}}},"profile_description_language":"ja","profile_image_shape":"Circle","profile_metadata":{"profile_interstitial_type":""},"profile_translation":{"translator_type":"none"},"relationship_counts":{"followers":1264644,"following":43},"relationship_perspectives":{"blocked_by":false,"blockin